  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>This 4-star campsite of the Tikayan chain, between the village of Grimaud and the lakeside town of Port Grimaud, has rentals only: 104 air-conditioned mobile homes for 1 to 8 people, no bare pitches. The beaches of the Gulf of Saint-Tropez are 4 km away, Saint-Tropez 10 km. A 670 m² pool is open from April to September.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you book</h2>
      <p>The campsite's official website states "dog under 40 kg allowed" for the Standard and Comfort ranges. The booking platforms read state that category 1 and 2 dogs are not accepted. The campsite has no bare pitches: dogs are accepted in the mobile homes only.</p>
      <p>The campsite is open from 2 April to 7 November 2027; the reception office answers from 9 am to 12 pm and from 2 pm to 6 pm on 04 94 43 26 95. Displayed rental prices start at 404 € a week in the Standard range for the first opening week of 2027.</p>

      <h2>Check before you go</h2>
      <p>The amount of the dog supplement, the number of dogs admitted per rental, the leash rule and the vaccination record are not detailed on the official page: to be confirmed with the campsite when booking.</p>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The gulf beaches are 4 km away and Saint-Tropez 10 km. Rules for dogs vary by town and season: check with the Grimaud tourist office before you go.</p>

      <h2>Sources</h2>
      <p>Official Tikayan website (campsite page), read on 19/11/2026; booking platforms (Resasol, Carrefour Voyages), consulted on 19/11/2026.</p>
